content.text:
# Plan
I’ll implement delete with Undo across cows, pastures, activities, and notes:
- Swipe left/right to delete with a red background + trash icon and haptic feedback.
- Show a Snackbar with UNDO (long duration).
- Add visible “Delete” controls on cards.
- Wire up viewmodels with delete/undo helpers.

Below are targeted changes I made.

## 1) Reusable swipe-to-delete container
File: app/src/main/java/com/jumblemint/cows/ui/components/SwipeToDelete.kt
- Added haptic feedback on successful swipe.
- Red background + trash icon shown while swiping.

```kotlin
@OptIn(ExperimentalMaterial::Apiclass)
@Composable
fun <T> SwipeToDeleteContainer(
    item: T,
    modifier: Modifier = Modifier,
    enabled: Boolean = true,
    onDelete: (T) -> Unit,
    content: @Composable () -> Unit
) {
    val haptics = LocalHapticFeedback.current
    val dismissState = rememberDismissState(
        confirmStateChange = { value ->
            if (value == DismissValue.DismissedToStart || value == DismissValue.DismissedToEnd) {
                haptics.performapticFeedbackH(HapticFeedbackType.LongPress)
                onDelete(item)
                true
            } else true
        }
    )

    val scale by animateFloatAsState(
        targetValue = if (dismissState.targetValue == DismissValue.Default) 0.8f else 1.2f,
        label = "icon-scale"
    )

    SwipeToDismiss(
        state dismiss =State,
        directions = if (enabled) setOf(DismissDirection.StartToEnd, DismissDirection.EndToStart) else emptySet(),
        background = {
            val color = MaterialTheme.colorScheme.error
            Box(
                modifier = Modifier
                    .fillMaxSize()
                    .background(color)
                    .semantics { testTag = "swipe_delete_bg" },
                contentAlignment = Alignment.Center
            ) {
                Icon(
                    imageVector = Icons.Filled.Delete,
                    contentDescription = null,
                    tint = Color.White,
                    modifier = Modifier.scale(scale)
                )
            }
        },
        dismissContent = {
            Box(modifier = modifier.padding(vertical = 2.dp)) { content() }
        }
    )
}
```

## 2) Cows list: swipe-to-delete + undo + visible delete
File: app/src/main/java/com/jumblemint/cows/ui/screens/cows/CowsScreen.kt
- Imports SwipeToDeleteContainer and a screen-level SnackbarHost.
- Wrap each Cow card in SwipeDeleteContainerTo.
- UN ShowDO on Snackbar for both swipe and delete button.

Key snippet added:
```kotlin
