LazyColumn(
    verticalArrangement = Arrangement.spacedBy(8.dp)
) {
    items(uiState.cows, key = { it.id }) { cow ->
        SwipeToDeleteContainer(
            item = cow,
            onDelete = { deleted ->
                scope.launch {
                    viewModel.deleteCow(deleted)
                    val res = snackbarHostState.showSnackbar(
                        message = "Cow deleted",
                        actionLabel = "UNDO",
                        duration = SnackbarDuration.Long
                    )
                    if (res == SnackbarResult.ActionPerformed) {
                        viewModel.undoDeleteCow(deleted)
                    }
                }
            }
        ) {
            CowCard(
                cow = cow,
                onClick = { onCowClick(cow.id) },
                onDelete = {
                    scope.launch {
                        viewModel.deleteCow(cow)
                        val res = snackbarHostState.showSnackbar(
                            message = "Cow deleted",
                            actionLabel = "UNDO",
                            duration = SnackbarDuration.Long
                        )
                        if (res == SnackbarResult.ActionPerformed) {
                            viewModel.undoDeleteCow(cow)
                        }
                    }
                }
            )
        }
    }
}
```

## 3) CowsViewModel: delete/undo helpers
File: app/src/main/java/com/jumblemint/cows/ui/viewmodel/CowsViewModel.kt
- Added suspend helpers:
```kotlin
suspend fun deleteCow(cow: Cow) { repository.deleteCow(cow) }
suspend funDelete undoCow(cow: Cow) {
    repository.insertCow(cow.copy(id = 0))
    loadC()
ows}
```

Note: Undo reinserts with id=0 so Room will autogenerate. If you want to preserve the same id, we can add DAO upsert/insert with explicit id.

## 4) Pastures list: swipe-to-delete + undo + visible delete
File: app/src/main/java/com/jumblemint/cows/ui/screens/pastures/PasturesScreen.kt
- Imported SwipeToDeleteContainer.
- Wrap each PastureCard with swipe-to-delete.
- For UNDO, re-insert the pasture (simple approach).

Snippet:
