## 5) Activities list: swipe-to-delete + undo
Files:
- app/src/main/java/com/jumblemint/cows/ui/screens/activities/ActivitiesScreen.kt
- app/src/main/java/com/jumblemint/cows/ui/viewmodel/ActivitiesViewModel.kt

Changes:
- Added SwipeToDeleteContainer around items.
- Snackbar UNDO.
- ViewModel helpers:
```kotlin
suspend fun deleteActivity(activity: Activity) = repository.deleteActivity(activity)
suspend fun undoDeleteActivity(activity: Activity) {
    repository.insertActivity(activity.copy(id = 0))
    loadActivities()
}
```

## 6) Notes list: swipe-to-delete + undo
Files:
- app/src/main/java/com/jumblemint/cows/ui/screens/notes/NotesScreen.kt
- app/src/main/java/com/jumblemint/cows/ui/viewmodel/NotesViewModel.kt

Changes:
- Imported SwipeToDeleteContainer and wrapped NoteCard.
- Snackbar UNDO uses restoreNote (already present).
- Updated calls to use restoreNote for UNDO.

## 7) Visible delete controls
- CowCard has an optional onDelete button rendered on the right, so users who don’t discover swipe have an explicit action.
- PastureCard already had a delete TextButton; we kept it and added swipe too.
- Activities and Notes rely on swipe + delete flows; can add overflow/trash later if desired.

## 8) Polish
- Haptic feedback added on swipe success.
- You can disable swipe per item by passing enabled=false to SwipeToDeleteContainer when needed.

## Next steps and options
- Multi-select + trash: I can add Selection state, long-press selection, and a top app bar with a trash action across these lists. Want me to proceed for cows, pastures, activities, and notes?
- Permanent delete confirmation: If any delete is irreversible, I’ll switch to a confirmation dialog instead of Snackbar UNDO for that path.
